> 
> Gnomes are always neutral in my experience.

Dwarves are lawful and gnomes are neutral, but dwarves and gnomes are
friendly to each other, so if you're playing a dwarven or gnomish
character, the dwarves and gnomes in the Mines will be peaceful.

Monsters which are coaligned with you have a chance of being peaceful,
and it seems that this happens more often with lawfuls.  E.g. dwarves
are usually peaceful to lawful humans, but gnomes are only sometimes
peaceful to neutral humans.
